  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_1/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">1써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_2/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">2써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_3/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">3써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_4/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">4써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_5/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">5써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_6/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">6써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_7/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">7써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_8/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">8써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_s/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">마법책만들기와 기초운용</font></a></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:20; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">\n                        &nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"560\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/gate_travel.gif\" width=\"44\">Gate \n                                        Travel</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Vas \n                                        Rel Por&nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> 지속시간 \n                                        : 30초</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Black \n                                        Pearl, Mandrake Root, Sulphurous Ash</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Gate Travel는 4써클 리콜마법과 동일합니다. \n                                        하지만 리콜은 주문자만 장소이동을 하실 \n                                        수 있지만 게이트마법은 차원이동의 게이트를 \n                                        열어 동행자나 애완동물과 같이 장소 이동을 \n                                        하실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">펠루지역은 \n                                        분홍색을 발현하며 르네는 원래의 색인 \n                                        파랑색입니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/mana_vampire.gif\" width=\"44\">Mana \n                                        Vampire </b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        :</span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> Ort \n                                        Sanct&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지속시간 \n                                        : 즉시</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Black \n                                        Pearl, Blood Moss, Mandrake Root, Spider's \n                                        Silk </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Mana Vampire 은 주문으로 목표물의 \n                                        마나를 빨아들이는 마법입니다. 주문자의 \n                                        이벨이</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">높을수록 \n                                        더 많은 양의 마나를 흡수 할 수 있습니다. \n                                        방어자는 레지스킬로 이 효과를 감소 시킬 \n                                        수 있습니다. 또한 방어자가 지닌 마나 \n                                        이상의 마나를 흡수 할 수는 없습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\" width=\"540\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">계산공식 \n                                                    : 주문자의이벨 - 방어자의 \n                                                    레지</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/flamestrike.gif\" width=\"44\">Flamestrike</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Kal \n                                        Vas Flam</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;지속시간 \n                                        : 즉시</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Spider’s \n                                        Silk, Sulphurous Ash</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        &nbsp;:&nbsp;Flamestrike는 불속성 최고 \n                                        마법으로 목표물에 거대한 불기둥을 세워 \n                                        강한 불속성 공격을 하게 됩니다.(지엠 \n                                        이벨,인스일때 64-69의 데미지를 주며 \n                                        방어자는 불속성 저항으로 해당 데미지를 \n                                        감소 시킬 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_sp_2/\"><font color=\"teal\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>전투계산공식(스펠데미지)</b></font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">편 \n                                        참조</font></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/polymorph.gif\" width=\"44\">Polymorph</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Vas \n                                        Ylem Rel&nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;지속시간 \n                                        : 메저리수치</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Blood \n                                        Moss, Mandrake Root, Spider’s Silk</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Polymorph은 주문자를 일시적으로 동물로 \n                                        변신을 가능하게 해주는 마법입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">가능한 \n                                        동물은 다음과 같습니다-Black Bear, Grizzly \n                                        Bear, Polar Bear, Chicken, Daemon, Dog, \n                                        Ettin, Gargoyle, Gorilla, Human Male \n                                        or Female, Lizard Man, Ogre, Orc, Panther, \n                                        Slime, Troll, or Wolf.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/chain_lightning.gif\" width=\"44\">Chain \n                                        Lightning</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Vas \n                                        Ort Grav&nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지속시간 \n                                        : 즉시</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Black \n                                        Pearl, Blood Moss, Mandrake Root, Sulphurous \n                                        Ash</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Chain Lightning은 라이트닝 마법의 \n                                        최고마법으로 거대한 에너지 공격을 목표물에게 \n                                        가하게 됩니다. 지엠 인스와 이벨을 가진 \n                                        주문자는 최고 64-69의 데미지를 줄 수가 \n                                        있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">또한 \n                                        다수의 목표물을 단 한번의 데미지로 나눠줄 \n                                        수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">방어자는 \n                                        에너지 저항 속성으로 데미지를 감소 시킬 \n                                        수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_sp_2/\"><font color=\"teal\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>전투계산공식(스펠데미지)</b></font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">편 \n                                        참조</font></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/energy_field.gif\" width=\"44\">Energy \n                                        Field </b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        :</span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> In \n                                        Sanct Grav</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;지속시간 \n                                        : 메저리스킬의 28%&nbsp;+2 (최고 35.6초) \n                                        </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Black \n                                        Pearl, Mandrake Root, Spider’s Silk, \n                                        Sulphurous Ash</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Energy Field 는 일시적으로 에너지 \n                                        장벽을 세우는 마법입니다. 돌장벽보다 \n                                        범위가 넓고</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지속시간이 \n                                        길어 좁은 장소에서 추격자를 따돌릴떄 \n                                        유용하게 쓰입니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/meteor_swarm.gif\" width=\"44\">Meteor \n                                        Swarm</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Flam \n                                        Kal Des Ylem</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;지속시간 \n                                        : 즉시</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-h